---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Pickup Request Received"
  description="Your ebin e-waste pickup request has been successfully submitted."
>
  <div class="bg-charcoal-50 min-h-[75vh] flex items-center py-20">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      
      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-10 sm:p-14 shadow-xl border border-charcoal-100 space-y-6">
        
        <!-- Animated Success Badge -->
        <div class="w-20 h-20 rounded-full bg-eco-100 text-eco-600 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto text-3xl">
          <svg class="w-10 h-10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <span class="inline-block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-eco-600 bg-eco-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">
          Request Logged Successfully
        </span>

        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-charcoal-900 tracking-tight">
          Thank you! We have your pickup request.
        </h1>

        <p class="text-charcoal-600 text-base leading-relaxed">
          Our Bengaluru operations coordinator has received your item details and address. Here is what will happen next:
        </p>

        <!-- Steps Timeline Box -->
        <div class="bg-charcoal-50 rounded-2xl p-6 text-left space-y-4 text-sm border border-charcoal-100">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-eco-600 text-white font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">1</span>
            <div>
              <p class="font-bold text-charcoal-900">Confirmation Call / WhatsApp</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-charcoal-500">We will call or message your number to confirm your time slot and technician dispatch.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-eco-600 text-white font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">2</span>
            <div>
              <p class="font-bold text-charcoal-900">Doorstep Collection & Verification</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-charcoal-500">Our representative will arrive at your address, verify devices, and issue an instant digital receipt.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-eco-600 text-white font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">3</span>
            <div>
              <p class="font-bold text-charcoal-900">Safe Material Recycling</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-charcoal-500">Your devices are transferred to authorized Karnataka State Pollution Control Board facilities for zero-landfill processing.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Reminder on device wipe -->
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 text-left text-xs text-amber-900">
          <p class="font-bold mb-1">💡 Quick tip before our team arrives:</p>
          <p>Please remember to backup personal data and remove SIM cards, memory cards, and cloud accounts from phones and laptops.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Action Links -->
        <div class="pt-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
          <a
            href="/"
            class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded-full text-sm font-bold text-white bg-charcoal-900 hover:bg-charcoal-800 transition-colors"
          >
            Return to Homepage
          </a>
          <a
            href="/price-guide/"
            class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded-full text-sm font-bold text-charcoal-700 hover:text-charcoal-900 bg-charcoal-100 hover:bg-charcoal-200 transition-colors"
          >
            Review Price Guide
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
